icon_check.png, icon_up.png and icon_down.png are the action bar icons from
PebbleOS (https://github.com/coredevices/PebbleOS), resources/*/base/images/
action_bar_icon_{check,up,down}.png, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
They have been recoloured from white to black for a transparent action bar.

menu_icon~color.png and menu_icon~bw.png are the launcher icon: the
25x25 Telegram paper plane with a black border. The SDK picks the
~color file on colour watches and the ~bw file on black-and-white ones.
The firmware's launcher tints every app icon by luminance (black on
colour watches, inverted on the highlighted row of black-and-white
watches), keeping only black, dark grey, light grey and white, so the
colour version uses a light grey fill rather than Telegram blue.
